  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "e99c0402-5223-1e9a-5ef8-471d8a8dd3c6",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "3804894f-38eb-2926-fc2f-47991d4574d6",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Firstly, Sister Eunice Bett, Principal of the Nursing School at MP Shah Hospital, along with her colleagues, visited CIME to discuss a forthcoming Memorandum of Understanding between AKU and MP Shah Hospital. The collaboration will include the use of Visually Enhanced Mental Simulation (VEMS) as a cost-effective method for training non-technical skills.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In another visit, a delegation from Linedata, a global financial technology, services, and solutions provider, toured CIME Nairobi. Linedata has been a key sponsor of AKU's initiatives in Kampala. During their visit, they had an unexpected encounter with a simulated emergency scenario, where the team successfully revived a \"patient\" named Dan, in honor of one of the rescuers. This visit provided a glimpse into the kind of impactful work that will take place at the upcoming University Centre in Kampala.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
